os, Ana e Tom, que acabam de se tornar amigos.","qs":[{"q":"Quem é professora?","opts":["Mia","Ana","Tom"],"ans":0},{"q":"Tom é de onde?","opts":["Brazil","Mexico","England"],"ans":2}]},{"t":"cloze","min":2,"text":"Mia is a teacher. Her {{class}} is on Maple {{Street}}. Today she has two new {{students}}. One student is Ana. The {{other}} student is Tom. Ana is from {{Mexico}}. Tom is from England. They say, \"{{Nice}} to meet you!\" Now they are friends.","bank":["students","other","Street","Mexico","Nice","class"]},{"t":"mcq","min":1,"title":"Como se diz em inglês?","items":[{"q":"Qual é o seu nome?","opts":["My name is Ana.","What's your name?","Sorry, what's your name again?"],"ans":1,"say":null},{"q":"Meu nome é Ana.","opts":["Sorry, what's your name again?","Nice to meet you, too.","My name is Ana."],"ans":2,"say":null},{"q":"Eu sou o Tom.","opts":["Sorry, what's your name again?","I'm Tom.","Nice to meet you, too."],"ans":1,"say":null},{"q":"Prazer em conhecer você.","opts":["This is my friend.","I'm Tom.","Nice to meet you."],"ans":2,"say":null},{"q":"Prazer também.","opts":["My name is Ana.","Nice to meet you, too.","Sorry, what's your name again?"],"ans":1,"say":null},{"q":"Este é meu amigo.","opts":["What's your name?","My name is Ana.","This is my friend."],"ans":2,"say":null}],"mode":"read"},{"t":"dict","min":2,"items":["I'm Tom.","Nice to meet you.","Nice to meet you, too.","My name is Ana."]},{"t":"write","min":3,"prompt":"Apresente-se por escrito: nome, e diga que é aluno(a). Depois apresente um amigo.","frame":"My name is ... I'm a student. This is my friend ... .","words":["name","my","your","first name","last name","nice","meet","student"]},{"t":"speak","min":3,"task":"Cada aluno circula pela sala: pergunta o nome de 3 colegas e apresenta um deles ao grupo.","hints":["What's your name?","My name is Ana.","I'm Tom.","Nice to meet you."]},{"t":"game","min":2,"title":"Jogo rápido","items":[{"q":"your","opts":["Eu sou o Tom.","sobrenome","Meu nome é A